																	<p>MPU6050 is MEMS 3-axis gyroscope and a 3-axis accelerometer on the same silicon die together with an onboard Digital Motion Processor&trade; (DMP&trade;) capable of processing complex 9-axis MotionFusion algorithms.</p>
<p>MPU6050 is with I2C interface and can connect to any board with UEXT.</p>		 						</div>
